repository-code: "https://github.com/tanish-jain-225/Battery_State_Estimator_BE_Project_2026_2027"
abstract: "A lightweight, data-driven battery state estimation system utilizing Reservoir Computing (Echo State Networks) as an accurate, low-overhead alternative to classical Extended Kalman Filtering and Coulomb Counting. Featuring a 2-RC Equivalent Circuit Model electro-thermal physics engine, online Recursive Least Squares (RLS) adaptation, MISRA-C compliant C99 firmware with Compressed Sparse Row (CSR) matrix acceleration, and a 100-neuron Verilog RTL datapath bit-exact verified (200/200 matches) on Xilinx Artix-7 FPGA."
keywords:
  - "battery-management-systems"
  - "state-of-charge-estimation"
  - "state-of-health-estimation"
  - "reservoir-computing"
